  "title": "Jagged Sweet Vietnamese Chicken Wrap",
  "description": "A peppery and shattering Vietnamese dish featuring sugar and ssam-wrap, perfect for a lazy Sunday, served on a bamboo tray.",
  "cuisine": "Vietnamese",
