  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a grill or grill pan to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together sugar, fish sauce, and lime juice.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and marinate for 10 minutes.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    " Warm the ssam wrap by wrapping it in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wrap by placing the chicken on the ssam wrap, followed by pickled carrots, cucumber, and mint leaves.",
    "Season with pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately on a bamboo tray."
